   "q": "The Board is confident in meeting the upgraded** market forecasts for the year",
   "file": "20211123_CLX_Interim-Results.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2022-03-01",
   "doc": "YE-TU",
   "fy": "FY23",
   "g": "RAISE",
   "s": 3,
   "q": "Furthermore, the Company will begin FY23 with a record order book across all product lines and it is anticipated that revenue and operating profit for FY23 will be materially ahead of market expectations.",
   "file": "20220301_CLX_Trading-Update.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2022-04-12",
   "doc": "YE-TU",
   "fy": "FY22",
   "g": "RAISE",
   "s": 1,
   "q": "As a result of this, the Board is pleased to confirm that the results for FY22 will be slightly ahead of current market expectations.",
   "file": "20220412_CLX_Acquisition-of-iTrinegy-and-Update-on-Trading.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2022-05-24",
   "doc": "FY R",
   "fy": "FY23",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 1,
   "q": "As a result of the continued high demand for Calnex's products and services, and the Group's record order book, the Board is confident of achieving another successful year of growth in FY23.",
   "file": "20220524_CLX_FY22-Final-Results.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2022-08-17",
   "doc": "AGM",
   "fy": "FY23",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": -1,
   "q": "As with the prior year, this may cause monthly revenue to fluctuate, and the Board expects there will be an H2 weighting to the Group's trading performance.",
   "file": "20220817_CLX_AGM-Statement.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2022-11-22",
   "doc": "H1 R",
   "fy": "FY23",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "Whilst it is sensible to look to the future with a degree of caution given the continuing component shortages and global macro-economic challenges, the Company's positive trading performance during the period and proven ability to manage component shortages underpin the Board's confidence that the Group's performance for FY23 will be in line with market expectations.",
   "file": "20221122_CLX_Interim-Results.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2023-03-07",
   "doc": "YE-TU",
   "fy": "FY24",
   "g": "CUT",
   "s": -3,
   "q": "Based on short-term order run-rates, the Board believes that the financial performance in FY24 will be below that achieved in FY23, with the Company's revenues more heavily weighted to H2 of FY24.",
   "file": "20230307_CLX_Trading-Update.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2023-05-23",
   "doc": "FY R",
   "fy": "FY24",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "Trading in Q1 FY24 has continued as anticipated, and the Board is confident in delivering results for the year in line with market expectations as revised in March 2023.",
   "file": "20230523_CLX_FY23-Final-Results.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2023-08-16",
   "doc": "AGM",
   "fy": "FY24",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "The Board remains confident in the delivery of results for the year in line with current market expectations.",
   "file": "20230816_CLX_AGM-Statement.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2023-10-10",
   "doc": "H1 TU",
   "fy": "FY24",
   "g": "CUT",
   "s": -3,
   "q": "The challenging market conditions mean the Board now anticipates that, whilst revenues are expected to increase in H2 versus H1, revenues for FY24 will be in the region of 20-30 per cent below current market expectations, depending on the timing of orders.",
   "file": "20231010_CLX_Trading-Update-and-Notice-of-Results.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2023-11-21",
   "doc": "H1 R",
   "fy": "FY24",
